{"3610700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rose Of Wind", "steam_appid": 3610700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Rose Of Wind</i> — a medieval tavern management simulator where you are tasked with reviving a legendary establishment and restoring its former glory! After your grandfather's passing, the tavern remained abandoned for a long time, and now it's time to fill it with life, warmth, and atmosphere once again.​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/c132ad3d3deb13c3cb8a91c4b9033694.poster.avif?t=1770836420\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/c132ad3d3deb13c3cb8a91c4b9033694.webm?t=1770836420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/c132ad3d3deb13c3cb8a91c4b9033694.mp4?t=1770836420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Serve Visitors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each visitor brings a new story. Treat them to delicious food, offer a warm bed, engage in conversation, or simply provide a cozy corner for rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/76fda427d3c821ea1f3b19171a4c6905.poster.avif?t=1770836420\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/76fda427d3c821ea1f3b19171a4c6905.webm?t=1770836420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/76fda427d3c821ea1f3b19171a4c6905.mp4?t=1770836420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare Dishes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your kitchen, discover new recipes for dishes and drinks, and enhance them with unique ingredients. Create exquisite meals that will become the hallmark of your tavern.​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/3ab272f1b53ad80a7a3bf629ca83a4a8.poster.avif?t=1770836420\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/3ab272f1b53ad80a7a3bf629ca83a4a8.webm?t=1770836420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/3ab272f1b53ad80a7a3bf629ca83a4a8.mp4?t=1770836420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brew Beverages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew alcoholic drinks, create unique cocktails and elixirs that will delight your guests. A new recipe means new opportunities to attract customers.​</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Delivery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the tavern's basement lies a peculiar place — a riverside dock where you receive supplies. Through it, you order everything you need: ingredients, wax for lighting the halls, coal for stoves and the distillery, as well as tools to repair furniture that guests might damage — accidentally or intentionally.​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/fb370bd6ab047ca3463553494af520de.poster.avif?t=1770836420\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/fb370bd6ab047ca3463553494af520de.webm?t=1770836420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/fb370bd6ab047ca3463553494af520de.mp4?t=1770836420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hotel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop the inn within the tavern. Add new rooms, upgrade them, and monitor their condition. A cozy lodging becomes another source of income and unique events.​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/b168d0eaa1d7775aa1a944dde3fed7a8.poster.avif?t=1770836420\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/b168d0eaa1d7775aa1a944dde3fed7a8.webm?t=1770836420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/b168d0eaa1d7775aa1a944dde3fed7a8.mp4?t=1770836420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a unique atmosphere in the tavern by changing its exterior and interior. Make your tavern truly memorable — a cozy home for all.​</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Airship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An airship regularly flies over the city, announcing events from the outside world: holidays, weather changes, and other news that can influence visitor behavior and mood. Listen carefully — these signals will help you prepare in advance!​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/97bf91836fd24f178772cb6f086b4ca9.poster.avif?t=1770836420\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/97bf91836fd24f178772cb6f086b4ca9.webm?t=1770836420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/97bf91836fd24f178772cb6f086b4ca9.mp4?t=1770836420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the medieval world, manage every aspect of the tavern, and create a place that attracts both locals and travelers from around the world. Can you restore your tavern's former glory and become a legend among adventurers, merchants, and travelers?​</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who knows what secrets the old tavern holds?​</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you uncover them all? Explore the stylized medieval world, manage every aspect of the establishment, and create a place where both locals and wandering souls will gather. Restore <i>Rose Of Wind</i> to its legendary glory and become part of a new story!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Rose Of Wind</i> — a medieval tavern management simulator where you are tasked with reviving a legendary establishment and restoring its former glory! After your grandfather's passing, the tavern remained abandoned for a long time, and now it's time to fill it with life, warmth, and atmosphere once again.​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/c132ad3d3deb13c3cb8a91c4b9033694.poster.avif?t=1770836420\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/c132ad3d3deb13c3cb8a91c4b9033694.webm?t=1770836420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/c132ad3d3deb13c3cb8a91c4b9033694.mp4?t=1770836420\" type=\"video/mp4\">