 recipe means new opportunities to attract customers.​</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Delivery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the tavern's basement lies a peculiar place — a riverside dock where you receive supplies. Through it, you order everything you need: ingredients, wax for lighting the halls, coal for stoves and the distillery, as well as tools to repair furniture that guests might damage — accidentally or intentionally.​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/fb370bd6ab047ca3463553494af520de.poster.avif?t=1770836420\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/fb370bd6ab047ca3463553494af520de.webm?t=1770836420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/fb370bd6ab047ca3463553494af520de.mp4?t=1770836420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hotel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop the inn within the tavern. Add new rooms, upgrade them, and monitor their condition. A cozy lodging becomes another source of income and unique events.​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/b168d0eaa1d7775aa1a944dde3fed7a8.poster.avif?t=1770836420\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/b168d0eaa1d7775aa1a944dde3fed7a8.webm?t=1770836420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/b168d0eaa1d7775aa1a944dde3fed7a8.mp4?t=1770836420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><